      "name": "Sidebar navigation item",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Active route treatment from the shared Router shell.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-route\" href=\"#overview\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>Overview</a>",
      "css": ".ds-route{font-family:var(--font-sans, Manrope),sans-serif;display:flex;min-height:40px;align-items:center;gap:12px;border-radius:var(--radius,.75rem);padding:0 12px;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;color:hsl(var(--sidebar-foreground));transition:color 150ms,background-color 150ms}.ds-route svg{width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-route:hover{background:hsl(var(--sidebar-accent)/.6);color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.ds-route[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:hsl(var(--sidebar-accent));color:hsl(var(--sidebar-accent-foreground));font-weight:500}.ds-route[aria-current=\"page\"] svg{color:var(--router-highlight)}.ds-route:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--router-highlight);outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Working Gateway",
    "overview": "Router uses a black and graphite foundation, warm white text, and restrained champagne emphasis. Manrope carries the public site and working console through the app’s self-hosted next/font setup. The existing Const mark and desktop particle backdrop remain the identity assets.\n\nThe finished interface uses open sections, fine dividers, and quiet bordered work areas. Density follows the task: broad public sections, compact console controls, and a narrower documentation reading column. Console preferences retain a light theme; the public site and documentation keep their scoped dark palette.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm type on black and graphite surfaces.",
      "Champagne for selection, focus, and highlighted technical values.",
      "Manrope throughout the shared shell and public headings.",
      "Dividers and tonal layering rather than decorative surface shadows."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Scope Rule",
        "body": "Keep the public hex palette scoped to public and documentation surfaces; console components follow the active semantic theme.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Shared Voice Rule",
        "body": "Use the Router Manrope alias for interface text and headings. Keep tabular numerals on prices, balances, and usage.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Surface Rule",
        "body": "Use tonal steps and fine borders for resting work areas; the observed primary panels do not need a decorative shadow.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the Const mark, black public foundation, and existing desktop particle backdrop.",
      "Do retain visible keyboard focus and the reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do pair mobile rates with their labels and units inside the available width.",
      "Do use semantic theme variables for console text, borders, fields, and controls."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add the desktop hero backdrop to mobile.",
      "Don't replace the Router font alias with the shared package’s Inter default.",
      "Don't force console light-theme controls into the public dark palette."
    ]
  }
}
